{
    "title": "Real Piano electronic keyboard",
    "description": "The Real Piano provides all the tools necessary to master the art of playing piano and electronic keyboard on your smartphone or tablet. Now you can easily play any music, anywhere! Feel the sensation of playing piano or electronic keyboard in a real band!\r\n\r\nWhat is a piano?\r\nA piano is a musical instrument that produces sound by striking strings with hammers. It's known for its wide range and versatility, making it suitable for various music genres.\r\n\r\nHaven't learned to play the piano yet?\r\nReal Piano offers multiple video lessons to support you, along with a variety of loops for interactive play-along experiences.\r\n\r\nDon't have access to a grand piano or an electronic keyboard? No problem! \r\nReal Piano provides a diverse range of instruments with high-quality sounds, enabling you to play any song you desire!\r\n\r\nYou don't need a physical piano or a digital keyboard to learn to play!\r\nReal Piano is an ideal choice for practicing or playing the piano quietly, without causing disturbance or requiring extensive space. Enjoy the freedom to practice piano anywhere you like!\r\n\r\nShow your friends how good you are at playing piano!\r\nShare videos of your performances with friends and on social media!\r\n\r\nThe Real Piano app allows both children and adults to learn the piano while having fun and enhancing their cognitive and motor skills. This piano game will stimulate your musical talent, making it easy to learn as if using a real piano instrument.\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? Become a pianist today!\r\n\r\n\r\nExplore the features of Real Piano:\r\n\r\n- 100 piano lessons: Learn to play piano with our lessons.\r\n\r\n- Full 7 octaves Scale: Explore the entire keyboard.\r\n\r\n- Keyboard and Chord Mode: Switch between playing on a real keyboard and playing chords effortlessly.\r\n\r\n- Adjustable Scale Size: Customize the keyboard to your preference.\r\n\r\n- Piano Chords Library: Access over 1500 chords.\r\n\r\n- Studio Audio Quality: Enjoy crystal-clear sound.\r\n\r\n- A Diverse Range of Instruments: acoustic pianos, synthesizers, electric pianos, organs, wind instruments, string instruments, guitars, basses and other ethnic instruments.\r\n\r\n- New Instruments Weekly: Keep your sound fresh.\r\n\r\n- Recording Mode: Record your tunes and share them on social media.\r\n\r\n- Interactive Loops: Play along with professionally crafted loops.\r\n\r\n- MIDI Support: Connect your MIDI devices for enhanced control.\r\n\r\n- Universal Compatibility: Works seamlessly on all screen resolutions, from smartphones to tablets (HD images).\r\n\r\n- Free App: No hidden costs.\r\n\r\n- Delay-Free Audio: Enjoy seamless sound.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTry it out and have fun with the best piano and electronic keyboard app on Google Play!\r\nMade for pianists, professional musicians, amateurs, and beginners alike!\r\nFrom the same creator of Real Drum.\r\n\r\nDon't wait any longer to become a pianist. Download Real Piano now!\r\n\r\nStay connected with us on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, and YouTube for expert tips on how to make the most of the app! Follow us: @kolbapps\r\n\r\nKolb Apps: Touch & Play!\r\n\r\nKeywords: electronic keyboard piano, acoustic piano, synth, e-piano, organ, winds, strings, guitars, bass guitar, world music, grand piano chords, electric, acoustic, solo, play, lessons, band, hero, game, music, learn, rock, kids, learn piano, piano for beginners, piano chords, play piano, piano chords for beginners, piano lessons for beginners, piano songs, piano simulator, virtual piano, band, heavy metal, pop, reggae, edm, classical",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Real Piano provides all the tools necessary to master the art of playing piano and electronic keyboard on your smartphone or tablet. Now you can easily play any music, anywhere! Feel the sensation of playing piano or electronic keyboard in a real band!<br><br>What is a piano?<br>A piano is a musical instrument that produces sound by striking strings with hammers. It&#39;s known for its wide range and versatility, making it suitable for various music genres.<br><br>Haven&#39;t learned to play the piano yet?<br>Real Piano offers multiple video lessons to support you, along with a variety of loops for interactive play-along experiences.<br><br>Don&#39;t have access to a grand piano or an electronic keyboard? No problem! <br>Real Piano provides a diverse range of instruments with high-quality sounds, enabling you to play any song you desire!<br><br>You don&#39;t need a physical piano or a digital keyboard to learn to play!<br>Real Piano is an ideal choice for practicing or playing the piano quietly, without causing disturbance or requiring extensive space. Enjoy the freedom to practice piano anywhere you like!<br><br>Show your friends how good you are at playing piano!<br>Share videos of your performances with friends and on social media!<br><br>The Real Piano app allows both children and adults to learn the piano while having fun and enhancing their cognitive and motor skills. This piano game will stimulate your musical talent, making it easy to learn as if using a real piano instrument.<br><br>So, what are you waiting for? Become a pianist today!<br><br><br>Explore the features of Real Piano:<br><br>- 100 piano lessons: Learn to play piano with our lessons.<br><br>- Full 7 octaves Scale: Explore the entire keyboard.<br><br>- Keyboard and Chord Mode: Switch between playing on a real keyboard and playing chords effortlessly.<br><br>- Adjustable Scale Size: Customize the keyboard to your preference.<br><br>- Piano Chords Library: Access over 1500 chords.<br><br>- Studio Audio Quality: Enjoy crystal-clear sound.<br><br>- A Diverse Range of Instruments: acoustic pianos, synthesizers, electric pianos, organs, wind instruments, string instruments, guitars, basses and other ethnic instruments.<br><br>- New Instruments Weekly: Keep your sound fresh.<br><br>- Recording Mode: Record your tunes and share them on social media.<br><br>- Interactive Loops: Play along with professionally crafted loops.<br><br>- MIDI Support: Connect your MIDI devices for enhanced control.<br><br>- Universal Compatibility: Works seamlessly on all screen resolutions, from smartphones to tablets (HD images).<br><br>- Free App: No hidden costs.<br><br>- Delay-Free Audio: Enjoy seamless sound.<br><br><br><br>Try it out and have fun with the best piano and electronic keyboard app on Google Play!<br>Made for pianists, professional musicians, amateurs, and beginners alike!<br>From the same creator of Real Drum.<br><br>Don&#39;t wait any longer to become a pianist. Download Real Piano now!<br><br>Stay connected with us on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, and YouTube for expert tips on how to make the most of the app! Follow us: @kolbapps<br><br>Kolb Apps: Touch &amp; Play!<br><br>Keywords: electronic keyboard piano, acoustic piano, synth, e-piano, organ, winds, strings, guitars, bass guitar, world music, grand piano chords, electric, acoustic, solo, play, lessons, band, hero, game, music, learn, rock, kids, learn piano, piano for beginners, piano chords, play piano, piano chords for beginners, piano lessons for beginners, piano songs, piano simulator, virtual piano, band, heavy metal, pop, reggae, edm, classical",
